			"notes": "**New Version (again): 5.2.0**\n\n### Features\n- Whistling while the cursor stands at a monster makes the wolves attack and skip the teleportation\n- 1 hp every 15 seconds of passive regeneration while sitting\n- New config options:\n  \"allowTeleport\"\n  \n  Whether the wolves teleport to you when too far away.\n  \n  \"teleportAtDistance\"\n  \n  Minimum distance for wolves to teleport to you.\n  \n  \"attackAcceleration\"\n  \n  Attack movement speed acceleration.\n  \n  \"maxSpeed\"\n  \n  Attack movement speed ceiling.\n\n  \"allowPassiveRegeneration\"\n\n  Whether wolves have passive regeneration while sitting.\n\n  \"passiveRegenerationRate\": 15\n\n  Passive regeneration interval as seconds.\n  \n> You might want to refresh your config file.\n\nSuggestion credits:\n\nAttack command\n- Walter Acosta\n\nMovement acceleration\n- Maker261\n- Walter Acosta\n\nPassive Regeneration\n- King\n\nhttps://modrinth.com/mod/better-wolf-companion-mod/version/5.2.0"
		},
